  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "話題、あのミニドラマで持ち切りだなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006015110020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ありがたい限りだね……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200601511/2006015110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やっぱりこういうタイプの仕事はすごいな\r\n咲耶は特に需要があるし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "強みだなって改めて思ったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006015110030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ふむ……\r\n確かに得意分野ではある",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601511/2006015110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、だよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今後もさ、いろんな咲耶を届けつつ、\r\n得意分野では確実にアピールしていく──",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうふうにできたらいいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶もファンの人たちも、\r\nみんながより満足していけるように",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006015110040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601511/2006015110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──っていうのは今後の話として",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006015110050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601511/2006015110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今はまず今回の大成功を労うべきかな？　と思うんだが、\r\nどうだろう？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶、自分にご褒美とかあげてるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006015110060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "え？\r\nうーん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601511/2006015110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006015110070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "反応をいただけること自体が、\r\nご褒美のようなものだし──",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601511/2006015110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうじゃなくて！\r\n他の人は関係なく、咲耶自身がしてみたいこととかさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──こういうの考えるの、\r\nあんまり得意じゃないって知ってるけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は少しずつ慣れてってほしいと思ってるから──\r\nこの機会に自分を甘やかしてみよう、咲耶",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006015110080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ええ……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601511/2006015110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006015110090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "うぅん……そうだな、えーと……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601511/2006015110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006015110100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………あ",
